    "拖动 K⁺、Ca²⁺、Mg²⁺ 滑杆，观察 T 波、U 波、QT、PR 与 QRS 的联动；再用病例和自测把形态变成决策。": "Drag the K⁺, Ca²⁺, and Mg²⁺ sliders to observe the interplay of T wave, U wave, QT, PR, and QRS; then use cases and self-tests to turn morphology into decisions.",
    "拖动画布可水平旋转 −180°～+180°、俯仰 −85°～+85°，从前面、后面、左外侧和顶部观察三个环；使用上方三行分别调整 P\/QRS\/T 环电轴。": "Drag the canvas to rotate horizontally from −180° to +180° and pitch from −85° to +85°, viewing the three loops from the front, back, left side, and top; use the three rows above to adjust the P\/QRS\/T loop axes separately.",
    "拖动钾、钙滑杆，实时观察 T 波、QT、QRS 与 U 波如何变化，并同步看到处理原则。": "Drag the potassium and calcium sliders to observe real-time changes in T waves, QT, QRS, and U waves, with synchronized management principles.",
    "持续监护，复查血钾与血糖。": "Continuous monitoring; recheck serum potassium and glucose.",
    "指南会更新；发现表述过时请通过“关于 \/ 勘误”提交，并附版本与链接。": "Guidelines are updated; if you find outdated wording, submit via “About \/ Errata” with the version and link.",
    "按「频率 → 节律 → 电轴 → 间期 → ST-T → 结论」的顺序读图，每一步即时反馈，最后再下诊断。用于建立不遗漏的判读习惯。": "Read the ECG in the order “rate → rhythm → axis → intervals → ST-T → conclusion,” with immediate feedback at each step, and make the diagnosis at the end. This builds a habit of interpretation without omissions.",
    "按压中断 <10 秒": "Compression interruption <10 seconds",
    "按频率 → 节律 → 电轴 → 间期 → ST-T → 结论六步读图，每一步即时反馈；最后提交诊断并进入错题本。": "Six-step ECG reading: rate → rhythm → axis → intervals → ST-T → conclusion, with instant feedback at each step; submit the final diagnosis and enter the mistake notebook.",
    "按 频率 → 节律 → 电轴 → 间期 → ST-T → 结论 的顺序读图，每一步即时反馈。": "Read the ECG in the order Rate → Rhythm → Axis → Intervals → ST-T → Conclusion, with immediate feedback at each step.",
