    "本地优先": "Local-first",
    "本页为教学摘要，不构成诊疗建议。药物剂量、电击能量、时间窗与抗凝方案必须以当地现行指南、药品说明书和设备为准。": "This page is an educational summary and does not constitute medical advice. Drug doses, shock energy, time windows, and anticoagulation regimens must be based on current local guidelines, drug labels, and device specifications.",
    "本页心电图与内容用于医学教育，不构成诊断或治疗建议；真实患者请结合病史、体检、化验与临床指南判断。波形为教学用途的形态学近似。": "The ECG and content on this page are for medical education and do not constitute diagnostic or treatment advice; for real patients, interpret in conjunction with history, physical examination, laboratory tests, and clinical guidelines. The waveforms are morphological approximations for educational use.",
    "本项目不提供个体化诊疗指令；药物剂量、电击能量与临床决策必须结合当地指南、设备和患者情况。": "This project does not provide individualized treatment instructions; drug doses, shock energies, and clinical decisions must be combined with local guidelines, equipment, and patient conditions.",
    "术语表用于学习与跨语言沟通；不同教材\/地区对个别术语的用法可能不同。": "The glossary is for learning and cross-language communication; different textbooks\/regions may use individual terms differently.",
    "来自不同教学团队的可插拔课程内容。课程包独立命名空间、独立版本与许可，经人工审阅后发布；不自动并入主课程或题库。": "Plug-in course content from different teaching teams. Course packs have independent namespaces, versions, and licenses, are released after manual review, and are not automatically merged into the main course or question bank.",
    "极度右偏 \/ 不确定": "Extreme right axis \/ indeterminate",
    "根据最近答题与章节正确率，选出 3 个最该巩固的诊断，生成一局专项练习。未配置 AI 时使用本地算法。": "Based on recent answers and chapter accuracy, select the 3 diagnoses most in need of reinforcement and generate a targeted practice round. Uses a local algorithm when AI is not configured.",
    "模拟场景为教学虚构病例；操作与评分基于 ACLS 教学流程，不替代真实临床决策。": "Simulated scenarios are fictional teaching cases; actions and scoring are based on ACLS teaching protocols and do not replace real clinical decision-making.",
