    "每天 10 道全站同题的心电图判读，连续完成累计打卡；独立计分，不占用测试分。": "10 site-wide ECG interpretation questions on the same set daily; consecutive completion accumulates check-ins; scored independently and not counted toward test scores.",
    "每天 10 道心电图判读题，全站使用同一套题；每天只能完成一次，连续完成累计打卡。作答与判分在服务端完成，不占用每日练习的测试分。": "10 ECG interpretation questions per day, same set across the site; can be completed only once per day, and consecutive completions accumulate check-in days. Answering and scoring are done server-side and do not use the daily practice test score.",
